# MC-X-F12 (writer 9): a band with a version whose span isn't always stays law-dated ("A fact is law-dated when its value can change with the law date: an input, band, def or rule with a row or version whose span isn't `always`");
# r reads it and states no at: L §4.3 rule 3, LOAD-LAWDATE.
=== m.tally
model p
  tally 2
  on 2027-12-31
  start 2027-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
source act "the act"

input age3: int
band rate(a: int): money PLN
def r[m in months]: money PLN = rate(age3)
ask q: r[2027-05]

version v_act
  cite act
  governs 2027..
  known 2026-12-01
  age3 = 3 governs always "the age"
  rate: [0, 6) = 400.00 PLN "under 6"
  rate: [6, 18) = 250.00 PLN "6 to 17"
=== expect
refused: LOAD-LAWDATE r reads law-dated facts and states no at (m.tally:12)
